   "text": "from strands.interventions import Deny, Guide, InterventionHandler, Proceed\n\nclass ToolCallGate(InterventionHandler):\n    name = \"system1-tool-call-gate\"  # unique per agent\n    YES = 0.65  # the policy knob\n\n    def before_tool_call(self, event):  # runs before every tool call\n        call = event.tool_use  # what the model wants to run\n        p = yes_no_many(state, QUESTIONS)  # 1. System 1 observes...\n        if p[\"args_grounded\"] < self.YES:  # 2. ...plain Python decides\n            return Guide(feedback=f\"Blocked: {call} uses values the user never gave. Ask them.\")  # to the model\n        return Proceed()  # the tool runs",
   "originalText": "from strands.interventions import Deny, Guide, InterventionHandler, Proceed\n\nclass ToolCallGate(InterventionHandler):\n    name = \"system1-tool-call-gate\"  # unique per agent\n    YES = 0.65  # the policy knob\n\n    def before_tool_call(self, event):  # runs before every tool call\n        call = event.tool_use  # what the model wants to run\n        p = yes_no_many(state, QUESTIONS)  # 1. System 1 observes...\n        if p[\"args_grounded\"] < self.YES:  # 2. ...plain Python decides\n            return Guide(feedback=f\"Blocked: {call} uses values the user never gave. Ask them.\")  # to the model\n        return Proceed()  # the tool runs",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
